# power 4 or greater, so no ferocious) and Bot2 pays the {1}, so Duress resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Stubborn Denial
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Duress
Swamp x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
